  "title": "Contribution and constrained capacity",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Contribution and constrained capacity</h2><p>Analyze a single-product break-even model and an independent constrained-resource choice.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f1\">Unit contribution margin</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f2\">Break-even units</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f3\">Product X contribution per machine hour</label><input id=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f4\">Preferred product on contribution per scarce hour alone</label><select id=\"bar-m1-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"Product Y\">Product Y</option><option value=\"Product X\">Product X</option><option value=\"Equal contribution per hour\">Equal contribution per hour</option><option value=\"Cannot compare despite supplied hours\">Cannot compare despite supplied hours</option></select></div></section>",
