      "title": "Break-even model",
      "html": "<p>Selling price $75 per unit; variable cost $45; annual fixed cost $150,000. Assume the relevant range and a constant sales mix.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "bar-m1-tbs3-ex2",
      "title": "Machine-hour constraint",
      "html": "<p>Product X contributes $36 and requires 3 hours. Product Y contributes $28 and requires 2 hours. Demand exists for either product.</p>"
    }
