  "explanation": "<h3>Unit contribution margin</h3><p>$75 − $45 = $30.</p><h3>Break-even units</h3><p>$150,000 ÷ $30 = 5,000.</p><h3>Product X contribution per machine hour</h3><p>$36 ÷ 3 = $12 per hour.</p><h3>Preferred product on contribution per scarce hour alone</h3><p>Y earns $14 per hour versus X’s $12.</p>"
